<title>GERMANY: NRW Nov CPI down 0.1 pct mth/mth, up 1.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>NRW Nov CPI down 0.1 pct mth/mth, up 1.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state statistics office in the German state of North Rhine-Westphalia reported on Monday the following consumer price changes for November.</p>
<p>    Cost of living		Nov		   Oct</p>
<p>    Month/month (pct change)  -0.1		  +0.1</p>
<p>    Year/year		     +1.5		  +1.6</p>
<p>NOTE - This data is later combined with data from three other major German states to calculate the preliminary figure for the whole of west Germany.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
